        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Why does my bread loaf have a dense bottom layer?"
          }
        ],
        "sender": "human",
        "created_at": "2026-10-12T09:00:00.000Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-12T09:00:00.000Z",
        "attachments": [],
        "files": [],
        "parent_message_uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
      },
      {
        "uuid": "m2",
        "text": "",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "thinking",
            "thinking": "Dense bottom: under-proofed dough, too much water, or the oven floor not hot enough. Ask about the bake."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Usually the dough was under-proofed or the oven floor was not hot enough. How long did it rise, and do you bake on a stone?"
          }
        ],
        "sender": "assistant",
        "created_at": "2026-10-12T09:00:20.000Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-12T09:00:20.000Z",
        "attachments": [],
        "files": [],
        "parent_message_uuid": "m1"
      },
      {
        "uuid": "m3",
        "text": "",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Two hours, no stone."
          }
        ],
        "sender": "human",
        "created_at": "2026-10-12T09:02:00.000Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-12T09:02:00.000Z",
        "attachments": [],
        "files": [],
        "parent_message_uuid": "m2"
      },
      {
        "uuid": "m4a",
        "text": "",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Then let it rise longer."
          }
        ],
        "sender": "assistant",
        "created_at": "2026-10-12T09:02:10.000Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-12T09:02:10.000Z",
        "attachments": [],
        "files": [],
        "parent_message_uuid": "m3"
      },
      {
        "uuid": "m4",
        "text": "",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "thinking",
            "thinking": "Two hours may be enough in a warm kitchen; the missing stone is the stronger clue."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Preheat a heavy tray or a cast-iron pan for 30 minutes and bake the loaf on it; the bottom gets the heat it needs."
          }
        ],
        "sender": "assistant",
        "created_at": "2026-10-12T09:03:00.000Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-12T09:03:00.000Z",
        "attachments": [],
        "files": [],
        "parent_message_uuid": "m3"
      },
      {
        "uuid": "m5",
        "text": "",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thanks, I will try the cast-iron pan."
